moff-prayer-narsie-1 = 以血与影之名……

moff-prayer-narsie-2 = 我们献上这份祭品……

moff-prayer-narsie-3 = 愿她的黑暗拥抱……

moff-prayer-narsie-4 = 于纯净之血中……

moff-prayer-narsie-5 = 赞美血之几何学家！

moff-prayer-narsie-6 = Mah'weyh pleggh at e'ntrath!

moff-prayer-narsie-7 = H'drak v'loso, mir'kanas verbot!

moff-prayer-narsie-8 = N'ath reth sh'yro eth d'rekkathnor!

moff-prayer-narsie-9 = Dedo ol'btoh!

moff-prayer-narsie-10 = Gal'h'rfikk harfrandid mud'gib!
